    "photo_count": 3,
    "description": "Here is your opportunity to own 320 acres is a small community in the beautiful state of Montana.  Build your dream home, farm, ranch or quarry. The property is currently an open cut mining operation in Redstone Montana.  The construction aggregate material and landscaping rock meets or exceed Montana State standards. This gravel company is setup to handle all types of aggregate needs including Federal Highways. There is approximately 1M in crushed, screened and riprap. The rock quarry has an estimate of 20M tons of aggregate reserves.  The rock quarry produces a vast quantity of Rainbow River Stone. This property consists of approximately 320 acres of which 30 acres is currently permitted and can be expanded on this large acreage. All of the necessary licenses are up to date. Equipment for operation is included.  With the recent uptick in the oil industry this is growing area.  Seller financing available.",
